sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CHM as Chat Modal
    participant W as AI Worker
    participant TS as Tool Services
    participant MS as Mailchimp Service
    participant HS as HubSpot Service
    participant GS as Gmail Service
    participant API as Backend API

    Note over U, CHM: Worker needs to connect tools for task
    U->>CHM: "Set up email marketing campaign"
    CHM->>W: Process task request
    W->>W: Analyze required tools
    W->>CHM: "I'll need to connect to your email tools"
    
    Note over W, TS: Connect to Mailchimp
    W->>TS: Request Mailchimp connection
    TS->>MS: Check connection status
    MS->>TS: Connection active
    TS->>W: Mailchimp ready
    W->>CHM: " Connecting to Mailchimp..."
    
    Note over W, MS: Fetch subscriber data
    W->>MS: GET /api/audiences
    MS->>W: Return audience data
    W->>MS: GET /api/audiences/{id}/members
    MS->>W: Return subscriber list
    W->>CHM: Display subscriber statistics
    CHM->>U: Show "12,347 subscribers found"
    
    Note over W, TS: Connect to HubSpot
    W->>TS: Request HubSpot connection
    TS->>HS: Check connection status
    HS->>TS: Connection active
    TS->>W: HubSpot ready
    W->>CHM: " Connected to HubSpot"
    
    Note over W, HS: Get contact segmentation
    W->>HS: GET /api/contacts/segments
    HS->>W: Return segment data
    W->>CHM: Display segmentation breakdown
    CHM->>U: Show contact categories
    
    Note over W, TS: Attempt Gmail connection
    W->>TS: Request Gmail connection
    TS->>GS: Check OAuth status
    GS->>TS: OAuth token expired
    TS->>W: Gmail needs re-authorization
    W->>CHM: "Gmail connection needed"
    CHM->>U: Show OAuth prompt
    
    Note over U, GS: User authorizes Gmail
    U->>GS: Click "Authorize Gmail"
    GS->>U: OAuth consent screen
    U->>GS: Grant permissions
    GS->>TS: Return access token
    TS->>W: Gmail connection established
    W->>CHM: " Gmail connected successfully"
    
    Note over W, TS: Execute cross-platform task
    W->>MS: Create email campaign
    MS->>W: Campaign created
    W->>HS: Create contact workflow
    HS->>W: Workflow created
    W->>GS: Setup email forwarding
    GS->>W: Forwarding configured
    
    Note over W, CHM: Report integration success
    W->>CHM: "All tools integrated successfully"
    W->>CHM: Display completion summary
    CHM->>U: Show tool status indicators
    
    Note over W, API: Save integration state
    W->>API: POST /api/workers/{id}/tools/status
    API->>TS: Update tool connections
    TS->>API: Confirm updates
    API->>W: Integration state saved
    
    Note over TS, API: Monitor tool health
    TS->>MS: Periodic health check
    MS->>TS: Service healthy
    TS->>HS: Periodic health check
    HS->>TS: Service healthy
    TS->>GS: Periodic health check
    GS->>TS: Service healthy
    TS->>API: All tools operational
    
    Note over W, CHM: Handle integration failure scenario
    W->>TS: Request tool operation
    TS->>MS: API call fails
    MS-->>TS: Service unavailable
    TS->>W: Tool error reported
    W->>CHM: "Mailchimp temporarily unavailable"
    CHM->>U: Show error with retry option
    U->>CHM: Click "Retry"
    CHM->>W: Retry request
    W->>TS: Retry tool operation
    TS->>MS: Retry API call
    MS->>TS: Service restored
    TS->>W: Operation successful
    W->>CHM: " Connection restored" 